      "refersTo": "stock-cell",
      "description": "Readable stock quantity for the selected size, with exact-cell entry.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-size\"><div class=\"ds-size-header\">9</div><button aria-label=\"Polo Shirt MERAH Panjang, Baru ukuran 9: 12 pcs. Catat perubahan.\"><strong>12</strong><span>pcs</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-size{width:74px;background:var(--accent-soft,#eaf5fd);color:var(--accent,#0069aa);font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif}.ds-size-header{padding:8px 0;text-align:center;border-block:1px solid var(--line,#dfe6ef);font-size:11px}.ds-size button{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:100%;height:64px;padding:8px 2px;border:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;cursor:pointer}.ds-size strong{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-size span{font-size:10px;margin-top:3px;color:var(--muted,#586b83)}.ds-size button:hover{background:var(--accent-soft,#eaf5fd)}.ds-size button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#0879b9);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "File Selection",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Native file input with a consistent Indonesian blue choice control.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-upload\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4m14-7-5-5-5 5m5-5v12\"/></svg><strong>Pilih berkas stok</strong><span>Excel .xlsx, CSV, atau JSON · maksimal 5 MB</span><span class=\"ds-upload-choice\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Pilih berkas</span><input type=\"file\" aria-label=\"Pilih berkas stok\" accept=\".xlsx,.csv,.json\"/></label>",
      "css": ".ds-upload{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:11px;padding:28px 18px;border:1px dashed var(--line,#dfe6ef);border-radius:9px;background:var(--surface-soft,#f4f7fc);color:var(--accent,#0069aa);font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-upload strong{font-size:13px;max-width:100%;overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-align:center}.ds-upload>span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#586b83)}.ds-upload input{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;opacity:0;cursor:pointer}.ds-upload .ds-upload-choice{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:42px;padding:10px 17px;background:var(--accent,#0069aa);color:var(--surface,#fff);border-radius:var(--control-radius,8px);font-weight:600;font-size:12px}.ds-upload:hover .ds-upload-choice{background:var(--accent-hover,#00558a)}.ds-upload:focus-within{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#0879b9)}.ds-upload.ds-busy{opacity:.65;cursor:wait}.ds-upload.ds-busy input{cursor:wait}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The School Stock Workspace",
    "overview": "Pribadi’s school identity gives daily stock administration a clear, coherent home. White navigation and working surfaces carry navy text, while blue identifies actions, selected sizes, and active destinations. The official school logo sits directly on the sidebar with no colored box; retain its original red detail and proportions.\n\nThe workspace is compact and operational. Tables, direct Indonesian labels, visible quantities, and quick entry take priority. School identity comes from the palette, typography, and logo rather than decorative illustrations. The same language carries through stock lookup, movement, history, imports, settings, and the optional navy dark theme. Temporary shared mode hides application sign-in and officer management; the rail identifies Mode bersama instead of an officer or role. Preserved account screens remain available when account enforcement is restored.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "White working surfaces and navy hierarchy",
      "Blue actions, selection, and focus",
      "Self-hosted Inter and tabular quantities",
      "Horizontal size matrices and exact-cell movement handoff",
      "Name and total kept visible on mobile"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The School Identity Rule",
        "body": "Use the school blue and navy roles consistently across every screen and exported interface; preserve the official logo artwork.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Legible Action Rule",
        "body": "Use Action Blue for text and filled actions. School Blue is an identity accent, not a substitute for the darker action color.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Quantity Rule",
        "body": "Show the complete quantity, its size-system context, and a readable unit or state. Do not truncate numeric data to make a table fit.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Workspace Rule",
        "body": "Give stock data a stable plane; reserve floating depth for transient feedback and navigation overlays.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** preserve the official Pribadi logo and use white, navy, and school blue across all screens.",
      "**Do** use Action Blue for legible actions and School Blue for identity accents.",
      "**Do** keep quantities complete, aligned with tabular figures, and paired with size context.",
      "**Do** preserve selected-size centering and exact-cell movement handoff.",
      "**Do** keep uniform names and totals visible on mobile.",
      "**Do** pair stock and validation colors with explicit Indonesian labels.",
      "**Do** respect dark-theme role mapping and reduced-motion preference."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** introduce an unrelated brand palette or recolor the official logo.",
      "**Don't** replace horizontal size matrices with disconnected cards.",
      "**Don't** hide or truncate quantities or the mobile overview total.",
      "**Don't** combine old and new size identity in a stock cell.",
      "**Don't** add heavy shadows to ordinary working panels.",
      "**Don't** use color alone to indicate low stock, empty stock, or validation."
    ]
  }
